  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Details :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://upmsp.edu.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Uttar Pradesh Madhyamik Shiksha Parishad (UPMSP)</a> </span>has recently invited applications for Class 10th &amp; 12th Scrutiny 2025. The brief notification details for UP Board Scrutiny Form 2025 has been provided on this page. Online applying process for UP Board Scrutiny Form 2025 has started from 26 April 2025 &amp; the candidates can apply till 19 May 2025. Candidates must check the complete details for UP Board Scrutiny Form 2025 which has given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Madhyamik Shiksha Parishad (UPMSP)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UP Board 10th / 12th Scrutiny Online Form 2025</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Exam Name – UP Board 10th / 12th Annual Board Exam 2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>26 April 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>19 May 2025</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Challan Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>19 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Scrutiny Result Declared : <strong>Notify Later</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Each Subject <b>:</b> <strong>Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidate have to pay Rs 500/- fee for each subject in whichever subject they apply for scrutiny / Re Checking &amp; it can be paid through Challan Fee Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Exam Details</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exam Name – </strong>UP Board Class 10th / 12th Annual Board Exam 2025</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Exam Conducted By : </strong>Uttar Pradesh Madhyamik Shiksha Parishad (UPMSP) Conducted the Examination of Inter 10th / 12th Examination 2025</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UP Board 10th / 12th Scrutiny Online Form&nbsp;2025</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">The UP Board has declared the results of high school and intermediate on Friday. This time 90.11 percent of the candidates have passed in 10th high school and 81.15 percent in intermediate. Like previous years, this time also more girl students have passed the exam than boys. But now the application for scrutiny has started for the candidates who are not satisfied with their result in the examination.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UP Board 10th / 12th Scrutiny Online Form 2025</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Students of Class 10 (High School) and Class 12 (Intermediate) under the Uttar Pradesh Madhyamik Shiksha Parishad (UPMSP), Prayagraj, who are dissatisfied with their marks in any subject or with their overall result for the 2025 exams, can apply for scrutiny. Through this process, the answer sheet of the concerned subject will be re-evaluated, and a revised scrutiny result will be issued accordingly.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Apply UP Board 10th / 12th Scrutiny Online Form 2025</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Unsatisfied candidates with high school and intermediate results can now get themselves scuttled. Candidates can now apply online for scrutiny till May 19, 2025. A fee of Rs 500 per question paper has been fixed for the written and practical examination of Scrutiny. Following the necessary guidelines regarding scrutiny, application can be made on the website of UP Board, upmsp.edu.in. The application process for this has started.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Send UPMSP UP Board 10th &amp; 12th Scrutiny Form 2025 To</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Board of High School &amp; Intermediate Education UP, Regional Office, Civil Lines, Prayagraj (U.P.) – 211003, Pin Code : 211003, Phone Number : 0532-2423265.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Instructions To Send UP Board 10th / 12th Scrutiny Online Form 2025</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">To apply, one must fill out the online application form and obtain a printed copy of the Treasury Challan.</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">It must both be sent by registered post to the board office</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Any application received by post or courier without prior completion of the online form will be rejected by the board.</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">The deadline for sending the application and original challan copy via registered post is May 19th, 2025.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td c